  "title": "Schedule 1 (Additional Income and Adjustments to Income) v5: v4 plus line 8b gambling winnings itemized from the closed Form W-2G box 1 family; required when any closed subtotal (line 7, line 8b, line 21 or the top entry) is strictly greater than zero. Completeness swaps the Part I 'no other income' answer for w2g-scope.no-sch1-other-income-except-w2g; the line 8b subtotal is held by its own rule until the family is confirmed closed and the gambling-loss declaration is 'yes', so the attachment cannot complete while line 8b is held. Not a general Schedule 1 claim. v4 remains historical.",
